  + maximum machine form 16777216 bytes because both bounded downstream requests are embedded once

& [Receipt]
  + strict profile complete request composition reference and closed stage dispositions
  + project boot plan lifecycle prefix handoff later checkpoint succeeding proposal and verification identities through their existing canonical digests
  + status provider_free_chain_correspondence_verified authority supplied_data_correspondence_only physical_contact false
  + domain-separated request and receipt SHA-256 with only the receipt digest self-excluded

& [Derivation]
  + use existing validators and compilers; do not duplicate admission lifecycle handoff or succeeding-SOP rules
  + compare complete lifecycle values complete prefix transitions exact step classes exact attempt continuity complete later state and bridge evidence membership
  + independent verifier recompiles the complete expected receipt from its embedded request and requires equality

& [Bounds]
  + one composition identity and one bridge evidence identity must be distinct from lifecycle handoff proposal step attempt plan and predecessor SOP identities
  + all nested bounds remain enforced by their owning validators
  + unknown fields trailing JSON oversized JSON extra CLI arguments and output placement are refused

